Interchange StudentAssessment [2526]
    documentation 'The Student Assessment interchange describes test scores, quiz results, and 
                  'other information related to student assessments. The interchange schema can 
                  'carry results for many students or a single student.
    identity template Assessment [2526-001]
    identity template AssessmentItem [2526-002]
    identity template ObjectiveAssessment [2526-003]
    element StudentAssessment [2526-004]